stateDiagram-v2
    %% silenceper/pool channelPool — as-is representation.
    %% The canonical root analysis.json is the authority surface.
    %% This model does not encode to-be terminal waiter resolution or queued-Ping parity.

    [*] --> Active_HasIdle: construction with an idle connection

    Active_HasIdle --> Active_IdleExhausted_UnderCap: Get exhausts idle supply
    Active_IdleExhausted_UnderCap --> Active_HasIdle: Put makes a connection idle
    Active_IdleExhausted_UnderCap --> Active_IdleExhausted_AtCapacity: Get reaches capacity
    Active_IdleExhausted_AtCapacity --> Active_IdleExhausted_AtCapacity: Get queues

    Active_HasIdle --> Released: Release
    Active_IdleExhausted_UnderCap --> Released: Release
    Active_IdleExhausted_AtCapacity --> Released: Release
    Released --> Released: terminal calls
